state Site import lifecycle
// From: lib/plausible/imported/site_import.ex:14 (statuses), :43 (create_changeset), :53 (start_changeset), :59 (complete_changeset), :69 (fail_changeset),
// lib/plausible/imported/importer.ex:180-190,254 (run_import, mark_complete), lib/workers/import_analytics.ex:21-50 (perform), :58-100 (job exception handler), :115-145 (import_fail_transient, import_fail),
// lib/plausible/imported/google_analytics4.ex:24-37,101-127 (recoverable errors resume the same import)
tag Outcome as o
  In progress orange
  Succeeded green
  Failed red

[*] -new import-> Pending
Pending o: In progress
Pending -worker starts-> Importing
Importing o: In progress
Importing -all rows imported-> Completed
Importing -error or job discarded-> Failed
Completed o: Succeeded
Failed o: Failed
